This is a '''list of notable Chinese soups'''. [[Chinese cuisine]] includes styles originating from the diverse regions of China, as well as from Chinese people in other parts of the world. In China, a broth-based soup is usually consumed before or after a meal. [[Chinese noodles]] may be added to some of these soups to create [[Noodle soup|noodle soups]].

